        "composition": "image-evidence"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2f42e897-8507-4345-a743-18a4a6bbf96e",
      "name": "Reality is an excellent design review",
      "type": "intro",
      "status": "active",
      "content": {
        "text": "Floors have thresholds. Rooms have awkward corners. Wireless connections fail. Batteries run down. People walk through carefully planned routes.\n\nReal environments expose assumptions quickly. That is why Myomaton is built around physical experimentation rather than demonstrations that work only under ideal conditions.",
        "heading": "Reality is an excellent design review"
      },
      "page_id": "de8728f0-3bfe-40b4-a721-37f7779634d2",
      "variant": "stack",
      "version": 1,
      "metadata": {},
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T13:56:01.392948+00:00",
      "sort_order": 30,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-03T13:56:01.392948+00:00",
      "configuration": {
        "width": "wide",
        "divider": "none",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "alignment": "left",
        "treatment": "statement",
        "composition": "statement-break"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33113b1e-3a54-49d7-81f0-3f9ebe36a150",
      "name": "One person, amplified",
      "type": "intro",
      "status": "active",
      "content": {
        "text": "Myomaton is being developed by one person working extensively with AI.\n\nAI contributes synthesis, code assistance, documentation, structural reasoning, exploration, and coordination. Human judgment provides continuity of purpose, physical-world experience, priorities, values, and ultimate responsibility.\n\nThe goal is not to blur those roles. It is to use each where it is strongest and keep important project state externalized so the work remains understandable and correctable.",
        "heading": "One person, amplified"
      },
      "page_id": "de8728f0-3bfe-40b4-a721-37f7779634d2",
      "variant": "stack",
      "version": 1,
      "metadata": {},
