    {
      "id": "a6251ba4-01e7-41b4-87bf-288a864f5454",
      "name": "Why this exists",
      "type": "intro",
      "status": "active",
      "content": {
        "text": "Myomaton starts with a simple question: what should a useful personal robot actually be?\n\nThe answer should not depend on novelty alone. A useful robot should be affordable enough to matter, understandable enough to own, repairable enough to keep, and practical enough to earn a place in everyday life.",
        "heading": "Why this exists"
      },
      "page_id": "de8728f0-3bfe-40b4-a721-37f7779634d2",
      "variant": "stack",
