    {
      "id": "ca7d2a60-d54f-40b1-87fa-0673fe9e510a",
      "name": "A-Bot",
      "type": "intro",
      "status": "active",
      "content": {
        "text": "A-Bot explores a different problem: how one robot might help other robots remain useful.\n\nThe first role is practical and deliberately narrow — connecting, charging, and servicing smaller resident robots. That makes A-Bot both a robot in its own right and part of the larger household ecosystem Myomaton is exploring.",
        "heading": "A-Bot"
      },
      "page_id": "c4bcb2b1-84e0-4ef5-a374-383563ed7c85",
