      "name": "Open Practical Robotics",
      "type": "intro",
      "status": "active",
      "content": {
        "text": "Useful work should be shared clearly enough that other people can understand it, reproduce it, improve it, or take it somewhere new.\n\nMyomaton is developed in that spirit: document what proves useful, keep unnecessary barriers low, and be clear about what has actually been demonstrated.",
